From 4c69fbfba90c3c6551c96e76000e185e858b75bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:09:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(search): restrict search to a given set of note paths

Add a paths option (search option, MCP/stdio argument, CLI --paths-file) that
becomes a clause of buildFilterPredicate and is pushed into every retrieval
branch, so a restricted search equals a search over a vault holding only those
notes.

Patch-Id: restrict-paths
